    "summary": "Use it at the end of any phase. Pick a **GREY KNIGHTS PSYKER** unit of yours on the battlefield that has taken any **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** this phase, then:\n\n1. Pick an enemy unit that inflicted [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on it this phase.\n2. Roll 1 die per mortal wound your unit took this phase, from any source.\n3. For each 2+, the enemy unit suffers a [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), up to 6.\n\nThese mortal wounds count as Psychic Attacks.",
